# Copy to .env for local overrides. Leave VITE_API_URL unset during local
# development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000
# (see vite.config.ts), so the relative default already works.
#
# Set it when the SPA is hosted somewhere other than the API - on your static
# host, add this as a build-time environment variable:
VITE_API_URL=
# e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://massacre.pythonanywhere.com/api
